Package: stacserver
Title: Serve SpatioTemporal Asset Catalogs over a STAC API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Steven", "Pawley", , "dr.stevenpawley@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Serves STAC (SpatioTemporal Asset Catalog) metadata as a STAC API
    1.0 compliant HTTP service. Catalog objects built with the 'stacbuildr'
    package are ingested into a PostgreSQL/PostGIS database and exposed through
    a 'plumber' router implementing the core, item search and collections
    conformance classes. The router serves every request it receives, so access
    is enforced in front of it, for example by Posit Connect's content
    permissions. Optional helpers sign asset URLs for private object storage on
    Azure Blob Storage.
